Picking and Placing Parts with the PickAndPlace Robot
Pick and Place Parts with the PickAndPlace Robot
The PickAndPlace robot picks a part up at one station, rotates to another station and places it there. It can
pick up and deliver one ore more parts.
To deliver several parts, enter the Capacity.
Picking and Placing Parts with the PickAndPlace Robot
