Pick Up Several Parts and Place Them with the Robot
In our sample model the Sources create the parts. The object SourceContainers moves the containers
directly on to the AssemblyStation. The object SourceParts moves the parts to the PickAndPlace robot,
which picks them up, rotates, and delivers them to the AssemblyStation.
After the AssemblyStation has loaded the parts onto the container, it moves the loaded container onto the
Conveyor, which delivers it to the Drain.
